  "mainHtml": "<main class=\"bg-white\"><div class=\"bg-off-white\"><div class=\"container mx-auto px-4\"><div class=\"flex flex-wrap gap-1 mb-8 pt-8 lg:mb-16 breadcrumb\"><a href=\"/sv/questions\">Vanliga frågor</a><i class=\"icon\">chevron_right</i><a href=\"/sv/question_categories/selling\">Sälja</a><i class=\"icon\">chevron_right</i><span>Vad händer om någon skriver negativa kommentarer om min bil?</span></div><div class=\"lg:flex gap-16 mb-16\"><div class=\"lg:w-3/4\"><h1 class=\"font-serif text-5xl mb-8\">Vad händer om någon skriver negativa kommentarer om min bil?</h1><div class=\"bg-white rounded-lg p-8 auction-body\"><p>Alla kommentarer granskas av våra moderatorer, som ser till att kommentarsfältet håller god ton. Vi kommer inte att godkänna nedsättande eller negativa kommentarer om auktionerna som saknar relevans eller grund. Om du anser att en publicerad kommentar bryter mot våra kommentarsregler kan du höra av dig till <a href=\"mailto:support@biddershighway.com\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">support@biddershighway.com</a> så kommer vi att se över ärendet så fort vi kan.</p></div></div><div class=\"lg:w-1/4 mt-8 lg:mt-0\"><h2 class=\"text-xl font-semibold mb-6\">Kategorier</h2><ul class=\"flex flex-wrap gap-2 lg:block\"><li><a href=\"/sv/questions\" class=\"block lg:px-4 lg:py-3 font-semibold text-neutral-500 hover:text-neutral-600 transition-colors border rounded border-transparent\">Alla frågor</a></li><li><a href=\"/sv/question_categories/buying\" class=\"block lg:px-4 lg:py-3 font-semibold text-neutral-500 hover:text-neutral-600 transition-colors border rounded border-transparent\">Köpa</a></li><li><a href=\"/sv/question_categories/selling\" class=\"block lg:px-4 lg:py-3 font-semibold text-neutral-500 hover:text-neutral-600 transition-colors border rounded border-transparent px-2 border-black! text-black! hover:text-black!\">Sälja</a></li><li><a href=\"/sv/question_categories/bidding\" class=\"block lg:px-4 lg:py-3 font-semibold text-neutral-500 hover:text-neutral-600 transition-colors border rounded border-transparent\">Budgivning</a></li><li><a href=\"/sv/question_categories/documentation\" class=\"block lg:px-4 lg:py-3 font-semibold text-neutral-500 hover:text-neutral-600 transition-colors border rounded border-transparent\">Dokumentation</a></li><li><a href=\"/sv/question_categories/account\" class=\"block lg:px-4 lg:py-3 font-semibold text-neutral-500 hover:text-neutral-600 transition-colors border rounded border-transparent\">Konto</a></li><li><a href=\"/sv/question_categories/payment\" class=\"block lg:px-4 lg:py-3 font-semibold text-neutral-500 hover:text-neutral-600 transition-colors border rounded border-transparent\">Betalningar</a></li><li><a href=\"/sv/question_categories/shipping\" class=\"block lg:px-4 lg:py-3 font-semibold text-neutral-500 hover:text-neutral-600 transition-colors border rounded border-transparent\">Transport</a></li><li><a href=\"/sv/question_categories/verification\" class=\"block lg:px-4 lg:py-3 font-semibold text-neutral-500 hover:text-neutral-600 transition-colors border rounded border-transparent\">Verifikation</a></li></ul></div></div></div><div class=\"container mx-auto px-4 pb-16\"><div class=\"w-full p-8 bg-amber-100 rounded sm:flex justify-between items-center\"><div><h2 class=\"font-serif text-2xl sm:text-4xl mb-4\">Andra frågor?</h2><p class=\"text-sm sm:text-base mb-2 sm:mb-8\">Du kan skicka oss ett mejl. Vi hjälper gärna till!</p><a href=\"mailto:support@biddershighway.com\" class=\"font-bold underline hover:text-neutral-800\">support@biddershighway.com</a></div><a href=\"mailto:support@biddershighway.com\" class=\"hidden sm:block\"><img src=\"/assets/contact-us-4411369c.svg\" alt=\"Contact us\" class=\"w-48 h-36\"></a></div></div><div class=\"container mx-auto px-4 text-center py-8\"><a href=\"/sv\" class=\"inline-block rounded-sm cursor-pointer transition-colors px-4 py-2 text-white bg-jaffa hover:bg-zest disabled:bg-yellow-700 disabled:text-neu